\f0\b \cf2 Yes \'97 MQTT is actively being used and promoted as a transport/protocol layer for modern agentic AI multi-agent systems (including swarm-style coordination and governance), especially in IoT/edge/physical-AI contexts.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf2 It is not the dominant choice for pure cloud software-agent frameworks (those more often use HTTP, WebSockets, Redis, Kafka, or custom orchestrators), but it has clear real-world traction as infrastructure for scalable, decentralized agent swarms.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf2 Key real-world / production-oriented usage\
\pard\tx20\tx180\pardeftab720\li180\fi-180\partightenfactor0
