\f0\b\fs22 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone A2A over MQTT
\f1\b0  (Agent-to-Agent protocol): Open specification + SDKs for agent discovery (via retained \'93Agent Cards\'94 on hierarchical topics), request/reply, event delivery, and coordination. Hosted under projects like emqx/mqtt-for-ai.\
\ls1\ilvl1
\fs12\fsmilli6050 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	
\f2 \uc0\u9702 
\f1 	}
\fs22 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone EMQX Enterprise 6.2 adds a native 
\f0\b A2A Registry
\f1\b0  for agent discovery, liveness tracking, scoped authorization, and governance directly in the broker.\
\ls1\ilvl1
\fs12\fsmilli6050 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	
\f2 \uc0\u9702 
\f1 	}
\fs22 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Architecture pattern: one lightweight AI agent per device (or device group). Agents publish capabilities, discover peers via the broker, delegate tasks, maintain workflow state with retained messages, and recover via Last Will and Testament \'97 enabling self-coordinating fleets without a central orchestrator bottleneck.\
\ls1\ilvl1
\fs12\fsmilli6050 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	
\f2 \uc0\u9702 
\f1 	}
\fs22 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone EMQX Agent plugin / EMQX Agents: Turns the MQTT broker into an event-driven AI orchestration runtime (pipelines triggered by MQTT topics, LLM sessions, tool use, etc.).\
\ls1\ilvl1
\fs12\fsmilli6050 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	
\f2 \uc0\u9702 
\f1 	}
\fs22 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Explicit framing around \'93swarm of autonomous agents,\'94 discovery, negotiation, partial-result streaming, and graceful recovery.\
\pard\tx20\tx180\pardeftab720\li180\fi-180\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf2 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone HiveMQ
\f1\b0 : Whitepaper and blog series (\'93An MQTT Architecture for Scalable Agentic AI Collaboration\'94) mapping A2A semantics onto MQTT 5 (request-reply patterns, topic design for agent workflows). Demonstrates hybrid approaches that keep A2A payloads while using MQTT as the transport for scale and resilience.\
\ls1\ilvl0\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f0\b \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Research / open implementations
\f1\b0 :\
