\f0\b\fs22 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Federation of Agents (FoA)
\f1\b0 : Large-scale agentic AI framework using MQTT pub/sub for message passing, semantic capability routing, dynamic task decomposition into DAGs, and clustering of agents for collaborative refinement. Evaluated on benchmarks with significant gains over single-model baselines.\
\ls1\ilvl1
\fs12\fsmilli6050 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	
