\f0\b\fs36 \cf2 Recommended composition (best for an MQTT-heavy harness)\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs22 \cf2 Keep the MQTT client and agent loop in the trusted host process. Run untrusted tools / skills / generated code inside WASM sandboxes. Mediate 
\f5\i everything
\f0\i0  through explicit host capabilities.
\f1\b0 \
