\f0\b \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Capability declaration
\f1\b0 : Require a capabilities.json (or equivalent) per WASM tool that lists allowed topics, HTTP domains, workspace paths, etc.\
\ls5\ilvl0\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	3.	}
